sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Sensor as R307S
  participant ESP as ESP32 firmware
  participant RTC as DS3231
  participant FS as LittleFS journal
  participant WiFi as Private local Wi-Fi
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as SQLite

  Sensor-->>ESP: Match result: template slot only
  ESP->>RTC: Read valid local wall time
  RTC-->>ESP: Timestamp or invalid-clock error
  ESP->>ESP: Create UUIDv4 event
  ESP->>FS: Append JSON event + CRC and flush
  alt API available immediately
    ESP->>API: POST event (LIVE)
    API->>DB: Validate auth/slot/time/idempotency
    DB-->>API: RECORDED or DUPLICATE_SUPPRESSED
    API-->>ESP: Matching event_uuid and accepted outcome
    ESP->>FS: Append acknowledgement; compact acknowledged rows later
  else Network/API unavailable
    ESP-->>ESP: Show queued only after durable append
    loop Wi-Fi restored; oldest event each retry interval
      ESP->>API: POST same UUID, original time (REPLAYED_OFFLINE)
      API->>DB: Idempotent validation/insert
      DB-->>API: Stored prior/new outcome
      API-->>ESP: Matching UUID + accepted outcome
      ESP->>FS: Append acknowledgement
    end
  end

  Note over FS: Bounded at 100 pending/48 KiB; no auto-format. Queue is not encrypted.
  Note over Sensor,ESP: No fingerprint image or template data enters the event.
